OL,3,GNEWSAMan found with fatal head injuries
OL,4,Anamed by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died from head injuries in
OL,7,Fsouth London has been named as Thomas
OL,8,FCarey, a 39-year-old from Lambeth.
OL,10,FA murder investigation opened after
OL,11,FCarey was declared dead at a property
OL,12,Fon Poynders Road on 4 September.
OL,14,FThe Metropolitan Police said Carey's
OL,15,Ffamily had been told of his death and
OL,16,Fdetectives wanted to hear from anybody
OL,17,Fwho might have information about what
OL,18,Fhappened.
OL,20,FNo arrests have been made and the
OL,21,Finvestigation continues.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
